niri (26.04+lulo1-5) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Lulo OS build of upstream niri v26.04
    (commit 8ed0da44d974c32c6877d2f4630c314da0717ecb) with four patches.
  * New: debian/patches/0004-window-always-on-top.patch adds the IPC action
    `set-window-always-on-top` and `is_always_on_top` on IPC windows, so
    Window > Always on Top can pin a floating window above the others
    (rmac docs/parity.md CALC-08, docs/decisions/0031-niri-always-on-top.md).

 -- Jacob Samas <samasjacob@icloud.com>  Wed, 21 Oct 2026 08:00:00 +0000

niri (26.04+lulo1-4) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Lulo OS build of upstream niri v26.04
    (commit 8ed0da44d974c32c6877d2f4630c314da0717ecb) with three patches.
  * New: debian/patches/0003-ipc-report-window-move-edges.patch reports the
    screen edge or corner a window drag is at (WindowMoveEdgeChanged,
    WindowMoveEnded), so Lulo can tile a window dropped at an edge
    (rmac docs/decisions/0029-edge-drag-tiling.md).

 -- Jacob Samas <samasjacob@icloud.com>  Tue, 20 Oct 2026 18:00:00 +0000

niri (26.04+lulo1-3) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Lulo OS build of upstream niri v26.04
    (commit 8ed0da44d974c32c6877d2f4630c314da0717ecb) with two patches.
  * New: debian/patches/0002-virtual-keyboard-binds.patch runs compositor
    key binds for zwp_virtual_keyboard_v1 keys, so an on-screen keyboard can
    use Lulo's global shortcuts (rmac docs/parity.md ROBOT-13).

 -- Jacob Samas <samasjacob@icloud.com>  Wed, 14 Oct 2026 08:00:00 +0000

